  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業專利實務",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY PATENT PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "在產品開發的議題中，「智慧財產權」係指受法律保護的構想、概念、名稱、設計，以及和新產品相關的流程。智慧財產權使產業與企業中最有價值之一，因此本課程主要的目的是指導學生研究分析創意研發、科技以及專利之間的關係， 進而學習國內外專利檢所以及專利寫作實務。",
    "describe_eh": " In the issue of product development, \"intellectual property rights\" refer to concepts, concepts, names, designs, and processes related to new products that are protected by law. Intellectual property rights make one of the most valuable industries and enterprises, so the main purpose of this course is to guide students to study and analyze the relationship between creative R & D, technology and patents, and then learn about domestic and foreign patent inspection offices and patent writing practices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
