      "describe_en": "Possess professional knowledge of self-learing , and has the ability to plan and execute special research and write academic papers."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備創新思維及能夠獨立解決問題之能力",
      "describe_en": "Possess innovative thinking and ability to solve problems independently."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "具備掌握全球產業發展趨勢及技術接軌之能力",
      "describe_en": "Ability to master global industry development trends and technology integration"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "具備健全之職場倫理、社會責任及國際觀之思維。",
      "describe_en": "Possess sound thinking about workplace ethics, social responsibility and international outlook"
    }
  ],
